          <div style="margin-bottom: 28px;">
            <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--sdg-accent); margin-bottom: 12px;">
              Faculty and Research Mobility
            </h3>
            <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-primary); text-align: justify;">
